  "slug": "check-customer-ledger-pdf-before-sending",
  "title": "What to Check Before Sending a Customer Ledger PDF",
  "description": "Validate the actual file and the recipient so the statement matches the intended customer and reporting period.",
  "category": "Ledgers and PDFs",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Open the exported PDF itself",
      "body": "Read the top of the file. Match the company, exact customer name and date range against the request. If several PDFs were created together, open the file you intend to attach and verify it separately from the dashboard."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Confirm the details the recipient needs",
      "body": "Check that the exported statement includes the material transactions for the period and the expected opening and closing balances. If an amount looks different from TallyPrime, compare the report dates and source voucher first."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Send the right document to the right person",
      "body": "Confirm the recipient using your existing business contact record. Name the file with the customer and dates before sharing. If you correct the statement later, identify the corrected period and document version in the follow-up."
    }
  ],
